/v1/","context":{"app_id":4666890,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4666890-1847286114030333","game_id":"steam-4666890","kind":"announcement","title":"Gobs & Gears Built for Steam Deck!","summary":"Your Gobs are ready to travel. Gobs & Gears runs on our own custom engine, built from scratch with one goal in mind. Run well everywhere, including the Steam Deck in your hands! Here's what that means on Deck: Made for performance. No heavyweight engine underneath, just the game. It boots fast and keeps your loot routes moving smoothly even when your goblin operation gets out of hand. Scaled for the Deck's screen. The pixel art and UI are sized for the Deck's native resolution, so text stays cri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:06:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030333","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:33:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4666890-1846018067937673","game_id":"steam-4666890","kind":"announcement","title":"The Gob King Has Been On YouTube (He Is Unbearable Now)","summary":"\"Small but perfectly formed.\" — Orbital Potato The Gob King would like everyone to know he was on YouTube. Twice. He has watched both videos. Several times. Orbital Potato called it \"very weird, very zany\" and said it \"doesn't take itself too seriously at all.\" The King has chosen to hear only the compliments. Skip to the verdict. InterndotGif met the goblins and said: \"I don't know what they do, but I love them already.\" (They haul resources and they don't complain.) Play it free during Next Fe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T02:49:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937673","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4666890-1842846814439070","game_id":"steam-4666890","kind":"announcement","title":"GOBS & GEARS DEMO Build 274","summary":"Hey Gob Gang! Thanks for all the feedback and bug reports. Build 274 addresses a few issues regarding the tutorial text and added some Trundler camera quality of life. ImprovementsCamera focuses on selected Trundler in the Trundler UI Tab on mouse click or controller navigation selectAdd more tutorial tips and localizationFixesSwapping languages rebuilds text and button sizesThanks for playing the demo! Don't forget to wishlist Gobs & Gears and join our Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T02:25:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439070","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4666890-1841579228679550","game_id":"steam-4666890","kind":"announcement","title":"GOBS & GEARS DEMO — Build 261","summary":"Gobs & Gears Demo Build 261 is here and addressing a few tutorial issues, some conveyor belt bugs and the annoying Gob King. Thanks for all the reports and feedback so far. New- Conveyor Belts can now be connected to locked buildings in either directionImprovements- Improved Destroy Spare Smelty Hole tutorial. More flashing UI and guidance.- Tutorial action objectives finish quietly instead of blasting fanfare each time- Gob King speaks a little snappier and breathes between words, less noise ov","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T20:17:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228679550","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4666890-1841579228677094","game_id":"steam-4666890","kind":"update","title":"Gobs & Gears Demo Hotfix Build 255","summary":"Thanks everyone for checking out the Gobs & Gears demo so far! I really appreciate all the feedback and reports. Build 255 is coming down the pipe with a handful of small adjustments and fixes.Improvements- Build-mode vignette now stretches all the way to the controller bar- Lowered default SFX volume- Lowered default Gob King Voice volumeFixes- Fixed world navigation inputs getting stuck on controller- Fixed potential softlock in destroy tutorial step","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T02:20:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4666890-1841579228676161","game_id":"steam-4666890","kind":"announcement","title":"Gobs & Gears Demo out NOW!","summary":"The Gobs & Gears demo is live. Go get it. The Gob King wants his bomb. He wanted it five minutes ago. The factory that could build it is lost somewhere out in the Fog. Push out through the Fog. Find the factory buildings the Gobs misplaced. Wire them back together one Trundler at a time.Lay routes: Conveyors haul Resources from Building to Building. You draw the lines.Reveal the map: Scout Towers punch holes in the Fog. Lost Buildings are out there.Reclaim what's dead: Route the right Resources ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T17:14:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4666890":{"last_attempt_